{"ref":"BDB, קַרְנַ֫יִם","hw":"קַרְנַ֫יִם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנַ֫יִם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> conquered by Isr. <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:13\" href=\"/Amos.6.13\">Am 6:13</a> (so Gr We Now GASm, cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, לֹא דְבָר\" href=\"/BDB,_לֹא דְבָר\", dir=\"rtl\">לֹא דְבָר</a> p. 520 supr.; 𝔊 and most sub <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶרֶן</span> <strong>2</strong>); prob. in Bashan, = Καρναιν <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 5:43\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).5.43\">1 Macc 5:43</a>, <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 5:44\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).5.44\">44</a>, Καρνιον <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees II 12:21\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_II.12.21\">2 Macc 12:21</a>; also in <span dir=\"rtl\">עַשְׁתְּרוֹת ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:5\" href=\"/Genesis.14.5\">Gn 14:5</a> (v. iii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַשְׁתָּרוֹת³\" href=\"/BDB,_עַשְׁתָּרוֹת³\", dir=\"rtl\">עַשְׁתָּרוֹת</a> p. 800 supr.).","next":"BDB, קָרַס","prev":"BDB, קֶרֶן הַפּוּךְ"}